WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:04.210
When intelligence enters the real world,
how can we live alongside it?

00:04.990 --> 00:06.410
It all starts with language.

00:06.710 --> 00:09.910
Legal translation takes more
than fluent wording.

00:10.060 --> 00:13.150
It must preserve the boundaries of concepts
and the institutions that give them meaning.

00:13.790 --> 00:17.040
Across a whole document,
experts stay in the loop.

00:17.280 --> 00:22.200
Each revision can be traced to the source
and becomes knowledge the team can share.

00:23.030 --> 00:25.120
In law and medicine,
there is no room for guesswork.

00:25.870 --> 00:28.790
From the laws of eleven countries
to in-depth medical literature search,

00:29.330 --> 00:32.120
each conclusion is grounded
in a verifiable chain of evidence.

00:32.740 --> 00:34.960
Understanding documents is one step.
Understanding people is the next.

00:35.290 --> 00:39.730
EEG signals help interfaces sense
our cognitive state and adapt to us.

00:39.960 --> 00:41.040
Next, the physical world.

00:41.210 --> 00:44.040
Across virtual and physical spaces,
people work alongside robots.

00:44.170 --> 00:46.610
Observe, steer, and take over at any time.

00:47.560 --> 00:49.630 line:80%
Zero Two, draw me a heart.
